   "he": "סַבָּבָה, יַאלְלָה",
   "intro": "<p>The words that make you sound like you live here. <b>סַבָּבָה</b> (cool), <b>יַאלְלָה</b> (come on / let's go) and <b>וַאלְלָה</b> (really? / honestly) are in every conversation.</p><p>Each word on this site is tagged <i>slang, casual, neutral</i> or <i>formal</i> so you know where it fits.</p>",
