   "intro": "<p>Talking about yesterday. Common past forms to recognize: <b>הָיִיתִי</b> (I was), <b>עָשִׂיתִי</b> (I did), <b>אָכַלְתִּי</b> (I ate), <b>רָאִיתִי</b> (I saw), <b>הָלַכְתִּי</b> (I went). Join sentences with <b>כִּי</b> (because) and <b>אָז</b> (so).</p><p>Verb course: past tense of the weak verbs לִקְנוֹת (<b>קָנִיתִי</b>) and לָגוּר (<b>גַּרְתִּי</b>).</p>",
